      <section class="legal-section" id="collecte">
        <span class="legal-section-number">02</span>
        <h2 class="legal-section-title">Data Collected</h2>
        <div class="legal-section-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p>
          When you visit our website, we automatically collect the following
          types of data&nbsp;:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Approximate Location Data&nbsp;:</strong> country, region
            and city of origin of the connection, deduced from your anonymized
